  "details": "Yes, you read this correctly. Having \"Games\" as a tag on your world will currently not consider it a game world. However, using specifically the \"Game\" tag does. If you remove the S, it goes from not in the \"Games - Active\" category to shown in the \"Games - Active\" category.\n\nI'd like to suggest that this behavior changes. \n\nI and probably many other people have had worlds uploaded with specifically the \"Games\" tag, and it doesn't ever show up in the \"Games - Active\" section of VRChat at all because of this.",
